{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the power of yacht racing in a world class sailing simulation with AC Sailing! Take the helm of high-tech foiling AC40 yachts. Sail against the best sailors from around the world in competitive online races. Practice in challenging solo conditions to master the art of foiling and maneuvering. Race in Barcelona, using the authentic team yachts of the America's Cup. Whether you're a seasoned sailor or a casual beginner, AC Sailing is the game for you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fleet racing up to 8 yachts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Match racing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ranked and casual online modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Learn to sail with the tutorial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Free sailing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Race practice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Single Player Challenges</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2706370?t=1763411500","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2706370?t=1763411500","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706370/1f48aa8668dc1dc7c4297f0833b1308b33fa7b95/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763411500","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706370/1f48aa8668dc1dc7c4297f0833b1308b33fa7b95/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763411500","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the power of yacht racing in a world class sa